  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the salt-block in the oven at 400 degrees Fahrenheit for 30 minutes.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the ground cumin, ground coriander, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the green peas and cook until they are tender.",
    "Add the basmati rice and stir to combine with the pea mixture.",
    "Transfer the rice mixture to the preheated salt-block and cook for 20 minutes.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and serve hot."
  ],
